  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |                                                                
  | **TC-001** | BUG-1024 | Verify successful checkout with discount coupon (Base Case) | User is logged in, items in cart. | Valid      
  %-off coupon (e.g., 'SAVE10') | 1. Add item to cart. 2. Apply coupon. 3. Click 'Place Order'. | Order completes with 200 OK; correct   
  total calculated. | Functional | Critical | Positive |                                                                                 
  | **TC-002** | BUG-1024 | Verify checkout resilience under concurrent payment method shifts | User is logged in, items in cart. |      
  Coupon + Credit Card vs. PayPal | 1. Apply coupon. 2. Select Payment Method A. 3. Switch to Payment Method B. 4. Click 'Place Order'.  
  | Order processes without 500 Error; state remains consistent. | Integration | High | Regression |                                     
  | **TC-003** | BUG-1024 | Validate DB state post-checkout failure | Valid user session active. | Valid Coupon | 1. Apply coupon. 2.    
  Click 'Place Order'. 3. Check DB/Logs after 500 error. | No orphaned order records created; logs show specific stack trace for dev     
  debugging. | Error Handling | High | Edge Case |                                                                                       
  | **TC-004** | BUG-1024 | Boundary test: Coupon near max discount limit | Cart total is high. | Coupon with max cap | 1. Apply         
  high-value coupon. 2. Proceed to checkout. 3. Place Order. | Total correctly capped; transaction completes successfully. | Boundary |  
  Medium | Boundary |                                                                                                                    
  | **TC-005** | BUG-1024 | Negative test: Expired/Invalid coupon handling | Cart is ready. | Expired coupon code | 1. Apply expired     
  code. 2. Attempt checkout. | System rejects coupon gracefully; no 500 error triggered. | Negative | Medium | Validation |              
  | **TC-006** | BUG-1024 | Regression: Checkout without coupon | User is logged in. | None | 1. Add items to cart. 2. Place order       
