  | **TC-007** | BUG-1024 | Load/Stress test: Rapid coupon application/submission | User logged in. | Valid Coupon | 1. Apply coupon.    
  2. Click 'Place Order' multiple times (double-click scenario). | Server handles duplicate requests (e.g., 409 Conflict) instead of     
  500. | Error Handling | Low | Edge Case |                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                         
