  As a Senior QA Test Case Engineer, I have refined the test suite based on the bug report BUG-1024. This suite addresses the reported   
  500 error, integrates the missing environmental/gateway validations, and ensures proper logging and database integrity checks.         
                                                                                                                                         
  ### Test Suite: Checkout & Discount Coupon Integration (BUG-1024)                                                                      
                                                                                                                                         
  | TC ID | Req. Ref | Title | Preconditions | Test Data | Test Steps | Expected Result | Type | Priority | Coverage |                   
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |                                                                
  | **TC-001** | BUG-1024 | Verify successful checkout with discount coupon applied | User logged in with valid cart items | Valid       
  coupon code (e.g., "SAVE20") | 1. Add item to cart 2. Apply coupon 3. Proceed to checkout 4. Click "Place Order" | Order completes     
  successfully; 200 OK returned | Functional | High | Positive |                                                                         
  | **TC-002** | BUG-1024 | Verify Order Processing logs & DB state post-checkout | Database access/Log access enabled | Valid coupon    
  code | 1. Execute checkout with coupon 2. Monitor Application Logs 3. Query `orders` table | Order entry exists in DB; No 500 errors   
  in logs | System | High | Error Handling |                                                                                             
  | **TC-003** | BUG-1024 | Gateway Integration: Credit Card payment with coupon | Credit Card gateway active | Valid CC + Coupon | 1.   
  Apply coupon 2. Select Credit Card 3. Complete payment | Transaction processed correctly without 500 error | Integration | High |      
  Environment |                                                                                                                          
  | **TC-004** | BUG-1024 | Gateway Integration: PayPal payment with coupon | PayPal gateway active | Valid PayPal account + Coupon |    
  1. Apply coupon 2. Select PayPal 3. Complete payment | Transaction processed correctly without 500 error | Integration | Medium |      
  Environment |                                                                                                                          
  | **TC-005** | BUG-1024 | Verify checkout behavior with expired coupon | Coupon must be expired | Expired coupon code | 1. Apply       
  expired coupon 2. Attempt checkout | Error message shown; 500 error must not occur | Negative | Medium | Boundary |                    
  | **TC-006** | BUG-1024 | Error handling: Simulate server load during coupon checkout | Production-like environment | Heavy traffic    
  simulation | 1. Apply coupon 2. Place order under simulated high load | System handles request; 500 error avoided | Stress | High |    
  Regression |                                                                                                                           
  | **TC-007** | BUG-1024 | Validate calculation logic (Discount + Tax + Shipping) | Cart contains items + shipping | 15% discount code  
  | 1. Apply coupon 2. Verify total calculation 3. Checkout | Calculations are accurate; Checkout succeeds | Business Rule | High |      
  Positive |                                                                                                                             
  | **TC-008** | BUG-1024 | Edge case: Multiple coupons or invalid character input | Coupon field enabled | Special chars/Expired/Empty  
  | 1. Attempt to inject SQL/Scripts or empty strings in coupon field 2. Attempt checkout | Input sanitized; Application does not crash  
  (500) | Security/Input | High | Input Validation |                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                         
